eatre has during the decades developed and become a growing platform at the school. Johan Rabaeus and Sven Lindberg are two alumni famous for acting. On 28 August 2013, the Swedish School Inspectorate closed the school after recurring problems concerning abuse and bullying. The closure would apply for at least six months. On the evening of 28 August 2013, the boarding school announced", "draft": "EMPTY_DRAFT", "draft_f1_vs_gold": 0.0, "raw_len": 327, "prompt_tokens": 273, "completion_tokens": 73, "retrieval_scores": [0.8163251876831055, 0.8145668506622314, 0.8115096092224121]}, {"t": 2, "action_type": "search", "query_or_answer": "Lorentz & Sakarias discography collaborations", "obs_digest": "[1] Léo Margarit: 2000 : Jean-Pierre Llabador – El Bobo<br> 2002 : L-batt et Amikisun – Ewaka<br> 2003 : Bernard Margarit – Notes de Voyages<br> 2004 : Christophe Roncalli – XY<br> 2005 : Guitariste.com – CD Concept<br> 2007 : Zubrowska – 61<br> 2008 : Tania Margarit – Elea<br> 2008 : Christophe Roncalli – Je vous laisse le reste<br> 2008 : Wardanz – Wardanz<br> 2009 : Pain of Salvation - Linoleum EP<br> 2010 : Pain of Salvation - Road Salt One<br> 2011 : For All We Know - For All We Know<br> 2011 : Pain of Salvation - Road Salt Two<br> 2013 : Sign\n[2] Reverb Records: \"\"Angels and Demons, Space and Time\"\", Hypatia Lake 2007 \"\"Satellite Remixes\"\", High Violets \"\"Keep Quiet\"\", Lab Partners \"\"Tell Me Everything\"\", Drakes Hotel 2006 \"\"Musicfest NW 06\"\", Various Artists \"\"To Where You Are\"\", High Violets 2005 \"\"Wicked Branches\"\", Lab Partners \"\"Splinters of the Cross EP\"\", Basic with David J 2004 \"\"Trust Electricity\"\", The Upsidedown 2003 \"\"In a Different Place\"\", Various Artists 2002 \"\"NW Shoegazerbliss\"\", Various Artists \"\"Gothica\"\", Chequerboard \"\"Staros\"\", Nina Hynes \"\"Mono Prix\"\", Nina Hynes \"\"44 Down\"\", High Violets 2001 \"\"Reverb Compilation\"\", Various Artists \"\"Can I Sleep Now\"\", Nina Hynes \"\"January\"\",